    "slot_value": "Core operational data should have an essentially immediate recovery point objective: every update to critical operational data must be captured immediately, with no deliberate gap. Changes to access, configuration, and recovery-related information are especially non-negotiable; only clearly transient or informational changes that do not affect the system's actual state may be excluded.",
